      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Disconnecting and going to login dialog might happen more often than VRChat developer team expected if a user connects far from the server placed in US. At least, it is not rare issue for me connecting from Japan.\n\nIf I create friends instance and get disconnected, my friend can join to the instance, but I myself can not get in. In social menu, the status of a friend inside of the instance is \"online in a private world\" though it's \"my\" world.\n\nAnd if I send \"Req Invite\", the friend get following message \"{user-name} would like to join. You can ask {user-name} to invite them.\" How to do that ?! It's a nonsense.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
